{"quest":{"line_id":"14010535","line_type":"5","order":549,"title":{"cn":"珍贵的慰藉","en":"Priceless Comfort","jp":"心の拠り所","kr":"소중한 위로"},"description":{"cn":"你们帮助小女孩找回了与她相依为命的小法妖，并让她作为小法妖主人的身份得到了承认。","en":"You help a girl find the little sith that is her only companion in the world, and make sure she is acknowledged as its rightful guardian.","jp":"あなたたちは女の子の相棒であるケットシーを連れ戻し、彼女がケットシーの飼い主であることを証明した。","kr":"아이의 친구인 켓시를 찾아주고 아이가 켓시의 주인으로 인정받을 수 있도록 도와주었다."},"reputation_camp_id":"402","reputation_camp_title":{"cn":"萨罗克兰","en":"Sal'thorin","jp":"サロクディア","kr":"셀로클랜드"},"route":"#/season-4/daily/14010535","assets":[{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010535:1:1"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234360"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010535:1:2"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234370"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010535:1:3"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234390"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010535:1:4"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234400"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010535:1:5"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234410"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234420"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010535:1:6"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234430"}],"tasks":[{"task_id":"1","steps":[{"step_id":"1","pre_step_ids":[],"objective_title":{"cn":"与沙利叶对话","en":"Talk to Ravion","jp":"サリエと話す","kr":"사리에와 대화하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"与沙利叶对话，看看他是否需要帮助。","en":"Talk to Ravion and see if he needs any help.","jp":"サリエと話し、力になれることがあるか尋ねよう。","kr":"사리에와 대화해 도움이 필요한지 물어보자."}},{"step_id":"2","pre_step_ids":["1"],"objective_title":{"cn":"寻找哭泣的小孩","en":"Find the Crying Kid","jp":"泣いている子どもを探す","kr":"우는 아이 찾기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"在王城东边寻找沙利叶提到的那个哭泣的小孩。","en":"Search the eastern part of the royal city for the crying child Ravion spoke of.","jp":"王都の東で、サリエの言っていた泣いている子どもを探そう。","kr":"왕성 동쪽에서 사리에가 말한 우는 아이를 찾아보자."}},{"step_id":"3","pre_step_ids":["2"],"objective_title":{"cn":"与哭泣的平民女孩对话","en":"Talk to the Girl","jp":"平民の女の子と話す","kr":"울고 있는 평민 소녀와 대화하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"与哭泣的平民女孩对话，询问她发生了什么。","en":"Talk to the crying commoner girl and ask what happened.","jp":"泣いている平民の女の子と話し、何があったか尋ねよう。","kr":"울고 있는 평민 소녀와 대화해 무슨 일인지 물어보자."}},{"step_id":"4","pre_step_ids":["3"],"objective_title":{"cn":"帮女孩找回小法妖","en":"Find the Little Sith","jp":"ケットシーを連れ戻す","kr":"소녀를 도와 켓시 찾기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"原来小女孩哭泣是因为与她相依为命的小法妖走丢了。想办法帮她找回小法妖吧。","en":"The girl is crying because her only companion, a little sith, has gone missing. Find a way to help her get it back.","jp":"女の子は、相棒のケットシーがいなくなってしまったために泣いているようだ。何とかしてケットシーを連れ戻してあげよう。","kr":"소녀는 친구인 켓시를 잃어버려서 울고 있었다. 소녀를 도와 켓시를 찾아주자."}},{"step_id":"5","pre_step_ids":["4"],"objective_title":{"cn":"击退侍卫","en":"Repel the Guard","jp":"衛兵を撃退する","kr":"근위병 처치하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"一个骄傲的贵族男孩指示手下侍卫抢夺小法妖。击退贵族男孩的侍卫。","en":"A proud noble boy orders his guards to seize the little sith. Repel the guards.","jp":"傲慢な貴族の男の子の命令を受けて、衛兵がケットシーを奪っていた。衛兵を撃退しよう。","kr":"오만한 귀족 소년이 근위병을 시켜 켓시를 빼앗으려고 한다. 소년의 근위병을 처치하자."}},{"step_id":"6","pre_step_ids":["5"],"objective_title":{"cn":"与沙利叶对话","en":"Talk to Ravion","jp":"サリエと話す","kr":"사리에와 대화하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"与沙利叶对话，告知他事情已经解决。","en":"Talk to Ravion and let him know the matter has been taken care of.","jp":"問題が解決したことをサリエに伝えよう。","kr":"사리에와 대화해 일이 해결되었다고 알려주자."}}]}],"archive_scope":"Configured faction daily paths. Live assignment, NPC visibility and minigame/battle success are not simulated.","source_plot_joins":[{"plot":"14234360","asset":"ep4/quest_story_14234360","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep4/quest_story_14234360.asset","raw_sha256":"c4483805fc903cc45715f7b481e41d5276e38eaae9c3563275f7c337decca661","lpak":"binary_NodeCanvas_DialogueTree_17859706585472604641.lpak","offset":19770752,"size":1384,"identity":"14010535:1:1","field":"verified_npc_task_menu"},{"plot":"14234370","asset":"ep4/quest_story_14234370","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep4/quest_story_14234370.asset","raw_sha256":"c3e10c1f7540e1bb06772b662c782cb6e96b